<title>GERMANY: German January coffee imports up at 1.26 mln bags.</title>
<headline>German January coffee imports up at 1.26 mln bags.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>German net green coffee imports from outside the European Union totalled 1.26 million bags in January 1997 after 1.03 million bags in December and 865,553 bags in January 1996, the DKV coffee association said.</p>
<p>The total in the 1996 calendar year was 11.98 million bags (11.65 million 1995).</p>
<p>Brazil shipped 231,776 bags in January after 224,217  in December, Colombia 222,833 (203,847), Vietnam 89,689 (41,936), Guatemala 75,486 (38,525) and El Salvador 65,253 (57,519).</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
